[
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "CHAPTER III. A Caucus-Race and a Long Tale",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "",
    "trailing_silence_s": 1.0,
    "start_s": 0.0,
    "end_s": 3.84,
    "duration_s": 3.84,
    "title": true
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "text": "They were indeed a queer-looking party that assembled on the bank—the birds with draggled feathers, the animals with their fur clinging close to them, and all dripping wet, cross, and uncomfortable.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "descriptive",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 3.84,
    "end_s": 15.78,
    "duration_s": 11.94
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "text": "The first question of course was, how to get dry again: they had a consultation about this, and after a few minutes it seemed quite natural to Alice to find herself talking familiarly with them, as if she had known them all her life. Indeed, she had quite a long argument with the Lory, who at last turned sulky, and would only say:",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 15.78,
    "end_s": 34.26,
    "duration_s": 18.48
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_LORY",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "text": "I am older than you, and must know better;",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "sulky, haughty",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 34.26,
    "end_s": 36.780816,
    "duration_s": 2.520816
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 4,
    "text": "and this Alice would not allow without knowing how old it was, and, as the Lory positively refused to tell its age, there was no more to be said.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 36.780816,
    "end_s": 45.280816,
    "duration_s": 8.5
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 5,
    "text": "At last the Mouse, who seemed to be a person of authority among them, called out:",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 45.280816,
    "end_s": 49.520816,
    "duration_s": 4.24
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 6,
    "text": "Sit down, all of you, and listen to me! I’ll soon make you dry enough!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "authoritative, loud",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 49.520816,
    "end_s": 54.68000000000001,
    "duration_s": 5.159184
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 7,
    "text": "They all sat down at once, in a large ring, with the Mouse in the middle. Alice kept her eyes anxiously fixed on it, for she felt sure she would catch a bad cold if she did not get dry very soon.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 54.68000000000001,
    "end_s": 65.94000000000001,
    "duration_s": 11.26
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 8,
    "text": "Ahem! are you all ready? This is the driest thing I know. Silence all round, if you please! ‘William the Conqueror, whose cause was favoured by the pope, was soon submitted to by the English, who wanted leaders, and had been of late much accustomed to usurpation and conquest. Edwin and Morcar, the earls of Mercia and Northumbria—’",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "important, oratorical",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 65.94000000000001,
    "end_s": 89.07142900000001,
    "duration_s": 23.131429
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_LORY",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 9,
    "text": "Ugh!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "shivering, disgusted",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 89.07142900000001,
    "end_s": 89.63306200000001,
    "duration_s": 0.561633
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 10,
    "text": "The Lory shivered.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 89.63306200000001,
    "end_s": 90.71306200000001,
    "duration_s": 1.08
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 11,
    "text": "I beg your pardon! Did you speak?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "polite, annoyed",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 90.71306200000001,
    "end_s": 93.579638,
    "duration_s": 2.866576
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 12,
    "text": "The Mouse frowned.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 93.579638,
    "end_s": 94.69963800000001,
    "duration_s": 1.12
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_LORY",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 13,
    "text": "Not I!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "hasty, defensive",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 94.69963800000001,
    "end_s": 95.47025000000001,
    "duration_s": 0.770612
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 14,
    "text": "I thought you did. —I proceed. ‘Edwin and Morcar, the earls of Mercia and Northumbria, declared for him: and even Stigand, the patriotic archbishop of Canterbury, found it advisable—’",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "dry, lecturing",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 95.47025000000001,
    "end_s": 107.578005,
    "duration_s": 12.107755
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DUCK",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 15,
    "text": "Found what?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "confused, loud",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 107.578005,
    "end_s": 108.583719,
    "duration_s": 1.005714
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 16,
    "text": "Found it. Of course you know what ‘it’ means.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "cross, snappy",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 108.583719,
    "end_s": 111.62698400000001,
    "duration_s": 3.043265
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DUCK",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 17,
    "text": "I know what ‘it’ means well enough, when I find a thing. It’s generally a frog or a worm. The question is, what did the archbishop find?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "pragmatic, argumentative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 111.62698400000001,
    "end_s": 119.68576,
    "duration_s": 8.058776
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 18,
    "text": "The Mouse did not notice this question, but hurriedly went on.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 119.68576,
    "end_s": 123.72576000000001,
    "duration_s": 4.04
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 19,
    "text": "‘—found it advisable to go with Edgar Atheling to meet William and offer him the crown. William’s conduct at first was moderate. But the insolence of his Normans—’ How are you getting on now, my dear?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "dry, then solicitous",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 123.72576000000001,
    "end_s": 134.067733,
    "duration_s": 10.341973
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 20,
    "text": "It turned to Alice as it spoke.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 134.067733,
    "end_s": 135.987733,
    "duration_s": 1.92
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 21,
    "text": "As wet as ever. It doesn’t seem to dry me at all.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "melancholy",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 135.987733,
    "end_s": 139.34446799999998,
    "duration_s": 3.356735
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DODO",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 22,
    "text": "In that case, I move that the meeting adjourn, for the immediate adoption of more energetic remedies—",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "solemn, formal",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 139.34446799999998,
    "end_s": 145.47018199999997,
    "duration_s": 6.125714
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 23,
    "text": "The Dodo rose to its feet.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 145.47018199999997,
    "end_s": 147.35018199999996,
    "duration_s": 1.88
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_EAGLET",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 24,
    "text": "Speak English! I don’t know the meaning of half those long words, and, what’s more, I don’t believe you do either!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "impatient, rude",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 147.35018199999996,
    "end_s": 153.42365099999995,
    "duration_s": 6.073469
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 25,
    "text": "And the Eaglet bent down its head to hide a smile: some of the other birds tittered audibly.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 153.42365099999995,
    "end_s": 158.84365099999994,
    "duration_s": 5.42
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DODO",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 26,
    "text": "What I was going to say, was, that the best thing to get us dry would be a Caucus-race.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "offended, formal",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 158.84365099999994,
    "end_s": 164.26405899999995,
    "duration_s": 5.420408
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 27,
    "text": "What is a Caucus-race?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "curious",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 164.26405899999995,
    "end_s": 165.77646299999995,
    "duration_s": 1.512404
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 28,
    "text": "Alice did not want much to know, but the Dodo had paused as if it thought that somebody ought to speak, and no one else seemed inclined to say anything.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 165.77646299999995,
    "end_s": 173.52176899999995,
    "duration_s": 7.745306
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DODO",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 29,
    "text": "Why, the best way to explain it is to do it.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "confident",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 173.52176899999995,
    "end_s": 176.59115699999995,
    "duration_s": 3.069388
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 30,
    "text": "(And, as you might like to try the thing yourself, some winter day, I will tell you how the Dodo managed it.) First it marked out a race-course, in a sort of circle, (\"the exact shape doesn’t matter,\" it said,) and then all the party were placed along the course, here and there.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative, explanatory",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 176.59115699999995,
    "end_s": 192.07115699999994,
    "duration_s": 15.48
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 31,
    "text": "There was no \"One, two, three, and away,\" but they began running when they liked, and left off when they liked, so that it was not easy to know when the race was over. However, when they had been running half an hour or so, and were quite dry again, the Dodo suddenly called out:",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 192.07115699999994,
    "end_s": 207.07115699999994,
    "duration_s": 15.0
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DODO",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 32,
    "text": "The race is over!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "loud, declarative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 207.07115699999994,
    "end_s": 208.41646299999994,
    "duration_s": 1.345306
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 33,
    "text": "And they all crowded round it, panting, and asking, \"But who has won?\"",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 208.41646299999994,
    "end_s": 212.45238099999995,
    "duration_s": 4.035918
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 34,
    "text": "This question the Dodo could not answer without a great deal of thought, and it sat for a long time with one finger pressed upon its forehead (the position in which you usually see Shakespeare, in the pictures of him), while the rest waited in silence. At last the Dodo said:",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 212.45238099999995,
    "end_s": 227.69238099999995,
    "duration_s": 15.24
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DODO",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 35,
    "text": "Everybody has won, and all must have prizes.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "grand, benevolent",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 227.69238099999995,
    "end_s": 231.12748299999996,
    "duration_s": 3.435102
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 36,
    "text": "“But who is to give the prizes?” quite a chorus of voices asked.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 231.12748299999996,
    "end_s": 235.04748299999994,
    "duration_s": 3.92
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DODO",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 37,
    "text": "Why, she, of course,",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "matter-of-fact",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 235.04748299999994,
    "end_s": 236.83687099999995,
    "duration_s": 1.789388
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 38,
    "text": "The Dodo pointed to Alice with one finger; and the whole party at once crowded round her, calling out in a confused way, “Prizes! Prizes!”",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 236.83687099999995,
    "end_s": 245.37687099999994,
    "duration_s": 8.54
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 39,
    "text": "Alice had no idea what to do, and in despair she put her hand in her pocket, and pulled out a box of comfits, (luckily the salt water had not got into it), and handed them round as prizes. There was exactly one a-piece, all round.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 245.37687099999994,
    "end_s": 258.91687099999996,
    "duration_s": 13.54
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 40,
    "text": "But she must have a prize herself, you know.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "insistent",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 258.91687099999996,
    "end_s": 261.35931999999997,
    "duration_s": 2.442449
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DODO",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 41,
    "text": "Of course. What else have you got in your pocket?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "grave, serious",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 261.35931999999997,
    "end_s": 264.16748299999995,
    "duration_s": 2.808163
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 42,
    "text": "He turned to Alice.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 264.16748299999995,
    "end_s": 265.48748299999994,
    "duration_s": 1.32
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 43,
    "text": "Only a thimble.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "sad",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 265.48748299999994,
    "end_s": 266.57156499999996,
    "duration_s": 1.084082
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DODO",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 44,
    "text": "Hand it over here.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "authoritative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 266.57156499999996,
    "end_s": 267.73401399999995,
    "duration_s": 1.162449
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 45,
    "text": "Then they all crowded round her once more, while the Dodo solemnly presented the thimble, saying:",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 267.73401399999995,
    "end_s": 273.454014,
    "duration_s": 5.72
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DODO",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 46,
    "text": "We beg your acceptance of this elegant thimble;",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "ceremonial, pompous",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 273.454014,
    "end_s": 276.523402,
    "duration_s": 3.069388
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 47,
    "text": "and, when it had finished this short speech, they all cheered.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 276.523402,
    "end_s": 280.219729,
    "duration_s": 3.696327
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 48,
    "text": "Alice thought the whole thing very absurd, but they all looked so grave that she did not dare to laugh; and, as she could not think of anything to say, she simply bowed, and took the thimble, looking as solemn as she could.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 280.219729,
    "end_s": 293.03972899999997,
    "duration_s": 12.82
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 49,
    "text": "The next thing was to eat the comfits: this caused some noise and confusion, as the large birds complained that they could not taste theirs, and the small ones choked and had to be patted on the back. However, it was over at last, and they sat down again in a ring, and begged the Mouse to tell them something more.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 293.03972899999997,
    "end_s": 310.16299399999997,
    "duration_s": 17.123265
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 50,
    "text": "You promised to tell me your history, you know, and why it is you hate—C and D,",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "polite, hesitant",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 310.16299399999997,
    "end_s": 314.669116,
    "duration_s": 4.506122
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 51,
    "text": "she added in a whisper, half afraid that it would be offended again.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "whispering, fearful",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 314.669116,
    "end_s": 318.23483,
    "duration_s": 3.565714
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 52,
    "text": "Mine is a long and a sad tale!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "sighing, dramatic",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 318.23483,
    "end_s": 320.93850299999997,
    "duration_s": 2.703673
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 53,
    "text": "The Mouse turned to Alice.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 320.93850299999997,
    "end_s": 322.37850299999997,
    "duration_s": 1.44
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 54,
    "text": "It is a long tail, certainly, but why do you call it sad?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "wondering",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 322.37850299999997,
    "end_s": 326.28380899999996,
    "duration_s": 3.905306
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 55,
    "text": "Alice looked down with wonder at the Mouse’s tail. And she kept on puzzling about it while the Mouse was speaking, so that her idea of the tale was something like this:—",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 326.28380899999996,
    "end_s": 335.36380899999995,
    "duration_s": 9.08
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 56,
    "text": "Fury said to a mouse, That he met in the house, ‘Let us both go to law: I will prosecute you.—Come, I’ll take no denial; We must have a trial: For really this morning I’ve nothing to do.’",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "rhythmic, storytelling",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 335.36380899999995,
    "end_s": 347.270476,
    "duration_s": 11.906667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 57,
    "text": "Said the mouse to the cur, ‘Such a trial, dear sir, With no jury or judge, would be wasting our breath.’ ‘I’ll be judge, I’ll be jury,’ Said cunning old Fury: ‘I’ll try the whole cause, and condemn you to death.’",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "rhythmic, storytelling",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 347.270476,
    "end_s": 360.867211,
    "duration_s": 13.596735
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 58,
    "text": "You are not attending! What are you thinking of?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "severe, sharp",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 360.867211,
    "end_s": 363.466395,
    "duration_s": 2.599184
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 59,
    "text": "I beg your pardon. You had got to the fifth bend, I think?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "humble",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 363.466395,
    "end_s": 367.023266,
    "duration_s": 3.556871
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 60,
    "text": "I had not!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "sharp, angry",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 367.023266,
    "end_s": 368.08122499999996,
    "duration_s": 1.057959
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 61,
    "text": "A knot! Oh, do let me help to undo it!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "helpful, anxious",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 368.08122499999996,
    "end_s": 370.65428599999996,
    "duration_s": 2.573061
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 62,
    "text": "Alice was always ready to make herself useful, and looked anxiously about her.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 370.65428599999996,
    "end_s": 374.93428599999993,
    "duration_s": 4.28
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_MOUSE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 63,
    "text": "I shall do nothing of the sort. You insult me by talking such nonsense!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "offended",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 374.93428599999993,
    "end_s": 379.4009529999999,
    "duration_s": 4.466667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 64,
    "text": "The Mouse got up and walked away.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 379.4009529999999,
    "end_s": 381.2809529999999,
    "duration_s": 1.88
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 65,
    "text": "I didn’t mean it! But you’re so easily offended, you know!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "pleading",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 381.2809529999999,
    "end_s": 384.6638099999999,
    "duration_s": 3.382857
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 66,
    "text": "The Mouse only growled in reply.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 384.6638099999999,
    "end_s": 386.8838099999999,
    "duration_s": 2.22
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 67,
    "text": "Please come back and finish your story!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "calling out",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 386.8838099999999,
    "end_s": 388.7515649999999,
    "duration_s": 1.867755
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 68,
    "text": "Alice called after it; and the others all joined in chorus, “Yes, please do!” but the Mouse only shook its head impatiently, and walked a little quicker.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 388.7515649999999,
    "end_s": 397.2115649999999,
    "duration_s": 8.46
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_LORY",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 69,
    "text": "What a pity it wouldn’t stay!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "sighing",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 397.2115649999999,
    "end_s": 399.2782319999999,
    "duration_s": 2.066667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "OLD_CRAB",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 70,
    "text": "Ah, my dear! Let this be a lesson to you never to lose your temper!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "motherly, moralizing",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 399.2782319999999,
    "end_s": 404.0978239999999,
    "duration_s": 4.819592
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "YOUNG_CRAB",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 71,
    "text": "Hold your tongue, Ma! You’re enough to try the patience of an oyster!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "snappish",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 404.0978239999999,
    "end_s": 408.02925299999987,
    "duration_s": 3.931429
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 72,
    "text": "I wish I had our Dinah here, I know I do! She’d soon fetch it back!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "wishful",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 408.02925299999987,
    "end_s": 411.93455899999987,
    "duration_s": 3.905306
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_LORY",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 73,
    "text": "And who is Dinah, if I might venture to ask the question?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "curious, polite",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 411.93455899999987,
    "end_s": 415.32095399999986,
    "duration_s": 3.386395
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 74,
    "text": "Dinah’s our cat. And she’s such a capital one for catching mice you can’t think! And oh, I wish you could see her after the birds! Why, she’ll eat a little bird as soon as look at it!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "eager",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 415.32095399999986,
    "end_s": 424.03279099999986,
    "duration_s": 8.711837
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 75,
    "text": "This speech caused a remarkable sensation among the party. Some of the birds hurried off at once: one old Magpie began wrapping itself up very carefully, remarking:",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 424.03279099999986,
    "end_s": 432.9527909999999,
    "duration_s": 8.92
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "OLD_MAGPIE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 76,
    "text": "I really must be getting home; the night-air doesn’t suit my throat!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "hoarse, hurried",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 432.9527909999999,
    "end_s": 436.9103419999999,
    "duration_s": 3.957551
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 77,
    "text": "and a Canary called out in a trembling voice to its children:",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 436.9103419999999,
    "end_s": 440.0580969999999,
    "duration_s": 3.147755
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CANARY",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 78,
    "text": "Come away, my dears! It’s high time you were all in bed!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "trembling, anxious",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 440.0580969999999,
    "end_s": 443.3364639999999,
    "duration_s": 3.278367
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 79,
    "text": "On various pretexts they all moved off, and Alice was soon left alone.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 443.3364639999999,
    "end_s": 447.5964639999999,
    "duration_s": 4.26
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 80,
    "text": "I wish I hadn’t mentioned Dinah! Nobody seems to like her, down here, and I’m sure she’s the best cat in the world! Oh, my dear Dinah! I wonder if I shall ever see you any more!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "melancholy, tearful",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 447.5964639999999,
    "end_s": 457.3270759999999,
    "duration_s": 9.730612
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_POOL_OF_TEARS",
    "ordinal": 81,
    "text": "And here poor Alice began to cry again, for she felt very lonely and low-spirited. In a little while, however, she again heard a little pattering of footsteps in the distance, and she looked up eagerly, half hoping that the Mouse had changed his mind, and was coming back to finish his story.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 1.0,
    "start_s": 457.3270759999999,
    "end_s": 474.9670759999999,
    "duration_s": 17.64
  }
]